<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Create account | Drive</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Google+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root { --blue: #1a73e8; --ink: #202124; --muted: #5f6368; --line: #dadce0; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; color: var(--ink); background: #f8fafd; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; }
    h1, h2, button, .brand { font-family: 'Google Sans', Inter, sans-serif; }
    .page { display: grid; min-height: 100vh; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .visual { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 42px 8%; background: #e6f4ea; }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #5f6368; font-size: 22px; }
    .brand-mark { color: #34a853; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; }
    .visual-copy { max-width: 450px; }
    .visual-copy h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 58px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -1.5px; }
    .visual-copy p { max-width: 360px; margin: 22px 0 0; color: #4d6d57; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .orbit { position: relative; width: 210px; height: 210px; margin: 0 0 10%; border: 1px solid #a9d5b5; border-radius: 50%; }
    .orbit:before, .orbit:after { position: absolute; content: ''; border: 1px solid #a9d5b5; border-radius: 50%; }
    .orbit:before { inset: 25px; }
    .orbit:after { inset: 58px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 12px 35px #4b9b5d2b; }
    .orbit span { position: absolute; z-index: 1; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #34a853; font-size: 44px; }
    .form-side { display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 32px 24px; background: #fff; }
    .card { width: min(100%, 390px); }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #188038; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 400; }
    .subcopy { margin: 10px 0 32px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
    label { display: block; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #3c4043; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
    input { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 18px; padding: 13px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; color: var(--ink); background: #fff; font: inherit; font-size: 14px; outline: none; transition: border .18s, box-shadow .18s; }
    input:focus { border-color: #34a853; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #34a8531f; }
    button { width: 100%; margin-top: 5px; padding: 13px 18px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; background: #34a853; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; transition: background .18s, box-shadow .18s; }
    button:hover { background: #2d9148; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px #34a8533d; }
    .switch { margin: 26px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; text-align: center; }
    a { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) { .page { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .visual { min-height: 260px; padding: 26px 24px; } .visual-copy { margin-top: 54px; } .visual-copy h2 { font-size: 38px; } .visual-copy p, .orbit { display: none; } .form-side { min-height: calc(100vh - 260px); align-items: start; padding-top: 44px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <section class="visual"><a class="brand" href="/home"><span class="brand-mark">D</span> Drive</a><div class="visual-copy"><h2>Make room<br>for what<br>matters.</h2><p>Create one home for your projects, memories, and everything worth keeping.</p></div><div class="orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span>＋</span></div></section>
    <main class="form-side"><div class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Start organizing</p><h1>Create your account</h1><p class="subcopy">Set up your Drive workspace in less than a minute.</p><form action="/user/register" method="post"><label for="username">Username</label><input type="text" id="username" name="username" placeholder="Choose a username" autocomplete="username" minlength="3" required><label for="email">Email address</label><input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" minlength="13" required><label for="password">Password</label><input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="At least 5 characters" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="5" required><button type="submit">Create account</button></form><p class="switch">Already have an account? <a href="/user/login">Sign in</a></p></div></main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
